the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 14.

the actions are:
    the move a with *a role* is made; known as a.
    the move b with *a role* is made; known as b.
    the move c with *a role* is made; known as c.
    the move tick is made; known as tick.

the fluents are:
    *a thing* is a control; known as control.
    *a role* is a p; known as p.
    *a role* is played; known as played.
    *a role* is a q; known as q.
    *a role* is a r; known as r.
    *a thing* is a step; known as step.
    the goal of *a role* is *a number*; known as goal.
    the move a with *a role* is legal; known as legal_a.
    the move b with *a role* is legal; known as legal_b.
    the move c with *a role* is legal; known as legal_c.
    the game is terminal; known as terminal.

the templates are:
    the succ of *a thing* is *a second thing*.

the knowledge base parallelbuttonsandlights includes:

the text of the game is at "sources/parallelbuttonsandlights.hrf".

the succ of 1 is 2.

the succ of 2 is 3.

the succ of 3 is 4.

the succ of 4 is 5.

the succ of 5 is 6.

the succ of 6 is 7.

the succ of 7 is 8.

the succ of 8 is 9.

the succ of 9 is 10.

the succ of 10 is 11.

the succ of 11 is 12.

the succ of 12 is 13.

the move a with a role is legal at a time if
    the role is a control at the time
    and it is not the case that the role is played at the time.

the move b with a role is legal at a time if
    the role is a control at the time
    and it is not the case that the role is played at the time.

the move c with a role is legal at a time if
    the role is a control at the time
    and it is not the case that the role is played at the time.

the goal of a role is 100 at a time if
    the role is a p at the time
    and the role is a q at the time
    and the role is a r at the time.

the goal of a role is 50 at a time if
    the role is a p at the time
    and the role is a q at the time
    and it is not the case that the role is a r at the time.

the goal of a role is 50 at a time if
    the role is a p at the time
    and it is not the case that the role is a q at the time
    and the role is a r at the time.

the goal of a role is 50 at a time if
    it is not the case that the role is a p at the time
    and the role is a q at the time
    and the role is a r at the time.

the goal of a role is 25 at a time if
    the role is a p at the time
    and it is not the case that the role is a q at the time
    and it is not the case that the role is a r at the time.

the goal of a role is 25 at a time if
    it is not the case that the role is a p at the time
    and the role is a q at the time
    and it is not the case that the role is a r at the time.

the goal of a role is 25 at a time if
    the role is a p at the time
    and it is not the case that the role is a q at the time
    and it is not the case that the role is a r at the time.

the goal of a role is 0 at a time if
    it is not the case that the role is a p at the time
    and it is not the case that the role is a q at the time
    and it is not the case that the role is a r at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    13 is a step at the time.

when the move a with a role is made
    and it is not the case that the role is a p
then the role is a p.

when the move a with a role is made
    and the role is a p
then it is not the case that the role is a p.

when the move a with a role is made
then the role is played.

when the move b with a role is made
    and the role is a q
then the role is a p.

when the move b with a role is made
    and it is not the case that the role is a q
then it is not the case that the role is a p.

when the move b with a role is made
    and the role is a p
then the role is a q.

when the move b with a role is made
    and it is not the case that the role is a p
then it is not the case that the role is a q.

when the move b with a role is made
then the role is played.

when the move c with a role is made
    and the role is a q
then the role is a r.

when the move c with a role is made
    and it is not the case that the role is a q
then it is not the case that the role is a r.

when the move c with a role is made
    and the role is a r
then the role is a q.

when the move c with a role is made
    and it is not the case that the role is a r
then it is not the case that the role is a q.

when the move c with a role is made
then the role is played.

when the move tick is made
then it is not the case that left is played
    and it is not the case that right is played.

when the move tick is made
    and a thing is a step
    and the succ of the thing is a second thing
then the second thing is a step
    and it is not the case that the thing is a step.

when the move tick is made
    and left is a control
then right is a control
    and it is not the case that left is a control.

when the move tick is made
    and right is a control
then left is a control
    and it is not the case that right is a control.

it must not be true that
    the move a with a role is made
    and it is not the case that the move a with the role is legal.

it must not be true that
    the move b with a role is made
    and it is not the case that the move b with the role is legal.

it must not be true that
    the move c with a role is made
    and it is not the case that the move c with the role is legal.

initially 1 is a step
    and left is a control.

